# Joined Researchers // Secret Rendezvous: the condition is "more cards in hand than you" (CR 603.4). Bot2 empties its hand
# to three on turn two; Bot1 casts the Researchers on turn three and plays a land, leaving four cards, so at that end step
# (three) and at Bot2's end step on turn four (four cards, drawn for the turn - the same as Bot1's) no opponent has more,
# and it is never prepared.

[Bot1 Deck]
Joined Researchers
Mox Pearl x2
Island x4
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby x5
Island x15

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Joined Researchers.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 4

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Joined Researchers.Prepared = (absent)
